# APK Files Directory

Place your Android APK files in this directory.

## Current Setup:
- The download page expects: `driver-app.apk`
- File path in code: `/apps/driver-app.apk`

## To add your APK:
1. Place your APK file in this directory (`public/apps/`)
2. Name it `driver-app.apk` (or update the filename in `src/components/_components/download-app/DownloadButton.tsx`)

## Example:
- `public/apps/driver-app.apk` → accessible at `/apps/driver-app.apk`

